* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for CAB011M12FM3: drain ramp 0..800 V, gate held at -4.0 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=2.5 Kp=26.64 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.006498 Rs=0.5m Rg=3.2 Cgs=1.027e-08 Cgdmax=2.06e-09 Cgdmin=3e-11 a=0.04486 Cjo=5.89e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.01643 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 -4.0
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 800.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_CAB011M12FM3.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
